### Uma simulacao (lista de operacoes -> lista de impostos). Fica salva no historico.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/impostos/simulacao
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 10000},
  {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 20.00, "quantity": 5000},
  {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 5.00,  "quantity": 5000}
]

### Lote de simulacoes (varias linhas independentes)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/impostos/lote
Content-Type: application/json

[
  [
    {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 100},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 15.00, "quantity": 50},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 15.00, "quantity": 50}
  ],
  [
    {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 10000},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 20.00, "quantity": 5000},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 5.00,  "quantity": 5000}
  ]
]

### Historico: lista de simulacoes ja calculadas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/simulacoes

### Historico: detalhe de uma simulacao
GET http://localhost:8080/api/simulacoes/1

### Entrada invalida (retorna 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/impostos/simulacao
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"operation": "transferir", "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 100}
]
